    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rezr](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rezr) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 05 2025 26km NW of Bashky Terek. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 42.1574 longitude 71.2576. It impacted 25618 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
